@startuml swap-execution
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title Swap
caption Quote to aggregator.splitSwap. Wallet submits. Output returns to msg.sender. Numbers match the Architecture page.

actor User
participant Wallet
participant "api-server" as API
participant "Arc RPC" as RPC
participant Aggregator
participant "DEX venues" as Pools

User -> API : 1. GET /api/v1/quote
API --> User : 2. expected_output · sub_routes
User -> API : 3. POST /api/v1/build_tx
API -> RPC : 4. paused · ERC-20 and Permit2 allowances
RPC --> API : state
API --> User : calldata · value 0 · optional typedData
User -> Wallet : 5. sign approvals / Permit2 / swap
Wallet --> User : signed txs
User -> RPC : 6. submit (wallet, not the API)
RPC -> Aggregator : splitSwap
Aggregator -> Aggregator : 7. Permit2 pull
Aggregator -> Pools : 7. execute each hop
Pools --> Aggregator : hop outputs
Aggregator -> Aggregator : 7. require amountOut >= minAmountOut
Aggregator --> User : 7. transfer tokenOut + catalog sweep

@enduml
